#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:5
msgid "Multi-Engine Support"
msgstr "多引擎支持"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:7
msgid ""
"AIBrix serves models on vLLM, SGLang, TRT-LLM and xLLM in one cluster. "
"Set ``model.aibrix.ai/engine`` on the pod so the gateway can read that "
"engine's metrics under one set of names, then route each request to a "
"ready pod of the requested model."
msgstr ""
"AIBrix 可在同一集群中用 vLLM、SGLang、TRT-LLM 和 xLLM 提供模型服务。在 Pod 上设置 "
"``model.aibrix.ai/engine`` 后，网关会把该引擎的指标读成同一套名称，再把每个请求路由到所请求模型的就绪 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:10
msgid "Key Features"
msgstr "主要特性"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:12
msgid "Run vLLM, SGLang, TRT-LLM and xLLM pods in the same cluster."
msgstr "在同一集群中运行 vLLM、SGLang、TRT-LLM 和 xLLM Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:13
msgid ""
"Select the engine with the ``model.aibrix.ai/engine`` label on the pod "
"template."
msgstr "在 Pod 模板上用 ``model.aibrix.ai/engine`` 标签选择引擎。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:14
msgid "Map each engine's metric names onto one internal name used by routing."
msgstr "把各引擎的指标名映射到路由使用的同一个内部名称。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:15
msgid ""
"Skip a pod, for a policy that needs an engine metric, when that engine "
"does not export it."
msgstr "当某条策略需要某项引擎指标、而该引擎并未导出这项指标时，跳过对应 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:18
msgid "System Overview"
msgstr "系统概览"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:20
msgid ""
"The gateway discovers pods by ``model.aibrix.ai/name`` and reads "
"``model.aibrix.ai/engine`` from the same pod. It scrapes each pod's "
"metrics endpoint and translates the names with the mapping in "
"`pkg/metrics/metrics.go <https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/aibrix/blob/main/pkg/metrics/metrics.go>`_. Routing then uses "
"those names, or signals the gateway tracks itself. Query-based metrics, "
"described under *Supported Metrics*, are the ones computed by Prometheus."
msgstr ""
"网关按 ``model.aibrix.ai/name`` 发现 Pod，并从同一 Pod 读取 "
"``model.aibrix.ai/engine``。它抓取每个 Pod 的指标端点，并用 `pkg/metrics/metrics.go "
"<https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/aibrix/blob/main/pkg/metrics/metrics.go>`_ "
"中的映射转换名称。路由随后使用这些名称，或使用网关自己跟踪的信号。*Supported Metrics* 中所述的查询型指标由 "
"Prometheus 计算。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:22
msgid ""
"To configure a specific engine, apply the following labels on the pod "
"template:"
msgstr "要配置特定引擎，在 Pod 模板上设置以下标签："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:32
msgid "An empty ``model.aibrix.ai/engine`` label is treated as ``vllm``."
msgstr "未设置 ``model.aibrix.ai/engine`` 时按 ``vllm`` 处理。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:34
msgid "Supported engine label values: ``vllm``, ``sglang``, ``trtllm``, ``xllm``."
msgstr "支持的引擎标签值：``vllm``、``sglang``、``trtllm``、``xllm``。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:37
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:39
msgid ""
"The AIBrix cache watches pods that carry ``model.aibrix.ai/name`` and "
"reads ``model.aibrix.ai/engine`` from the same pod. Every metric AIBrix "
"uses internally has one abstract name (for example "
"``num_requests_waiting``) and a per-engine mapping to the name the engine"
" actually exports. The mapping lives in `pkg/metrics/metrics.go "
"<https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/aibrix/blob/main/pkg/metrics/metrics.go>`_ and is reproduced in "
"the table below."
msgstr ""
"AIBrix cache 会监视带有 ``model.aibrix.ai/name`` 的 Pod，并从同一 Pod 读取 "
"``model.aibrix.ai/engine`` 。AIBrix 内部使用的每个指标都有一个抽象名称（例如 "
"``num_requests_waiting`` ），以及按引擎映射到该引擎实际导出的名称。映射位于 "
"`pkg/metrics/metrics.go <https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/aibrix/blob/main/pkg/metrics/metrics.go>`_ ，并在下表中复现。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:45
msgid ""
"Metrics are scraped from each pod on the port given by ``model.aibrix.ai"
"/metric-port``, or port ``8000`` when the label is absent, at "
"``/metrics`` (``/prometheus/metrics`` for ``trtllm``). Requests are "
"forwarded to ``model.aibrix.ai/port``."
msgstr ""
"指标从每个 Pod 上由 ``model.aibrix.ai/metric-port`` 指定的端口抓取；若无该标签则使用端口 ``8000`` "
"，路径为 ``/metrics`` （``trtllm`` 为 ``/prometheus/metrics`` ）。请求转发到 "
"``model.aibrix.ai/port`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:48
msgid ""
"Routing policies read either an engine metric by its abstract name or a "
"signal the gateway tracks itself. A policy that scores pods on an engine "
"metric skips a pod whose engine has no mapping for it, and routes the "
"request to a random pod when no pod can be scored."
msgstr ""
"路由策略读取的要么是按抽象名称引用的引擎指标，要么是网关自行跟踪的信号。基于引擎指标给 Pod 打分的策略，会跳过其引擎没有该指标映射的 "
"Pod；若没有任何 Pod 可打分，则将请求路由到随机 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:52
msgid ""
"``least-request``, ``slo-least-load`` and ``slo-pack-load`` use load the "
"gateway tracks, so they behave the same on every engine."
msgstr ""
"``least-request`` 、``slo-least-load`` 和 ``slo-pack-load`` "
"使用网关自行跟踪的负载，因此在所有引擎上行为一致。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:54
msgid ""
"``load-balance`` also uses gateway-tracked load and output-token rate. It"
" reads ``kv_cache_usage_perc`` for KV pressure, and treats a pod with no "
"reading as fully free instead of dropping it."
msgstr ""
"``load-balance`` 同样使用网关跟踪的负载和输出 token 速率。它读取 ``kv_cache_usage_perc`` 来衡量 "
"KV 压力，并将没有读数的 Pod 视为完全空闲，而不是将其剔除。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:57
msgid ""
"``least-kv-cache`` reads ``kv_cache_usage_perc``, which every supported "
"engine maps."
msgstr "``least-kv-cache`` 读取 ``kv_cache_usage_perc`` ，所有受支持的引擎都提供该映射。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:58
msgid ""
"``least-latency`` and ``throughput`` need query-based metrics written "
"against vLLM metric names (see *Supported Metrics*), so use them with "
"vLLM only."
msgstr ""
"``least-latency`` 和 ``throughput`` 需要基于 vLLM 指标名称编写的查询类指标（参见 *支持的指标* "
"），因此只能用于 vLLM。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:60
msgid ""
"``least-utilization`` reads ``engine_utilization``, which only ``xllm`` "
"maps, so on vLLM, SGLang and TRT-LLM it falls back to a random pod."
msgstr ""
"``least-utilization`` 读取 ``engine_utilization``，只有 ``xllm`` 提供这项映射，因此在 "
"vLLM、SGLang 和 TRT-LLM 上会退回到随机 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:62
msgid ""
"``least-busy-time`` reads ``gpu_busy_time_ratio``. No engine maps that "
"metric, so it always falls back to a random pod."
msgstr ""
"``least-busy-time`` 读取 ``gpu_busy_time_ratio``。没有任何引擎映射这项指标，因此它始终退回到随机 "
"Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:65
msgid ""
"The optional :doc:`runtime` sidecar is a separate mechanism and works "
"with vLLM only today. It serves the engine's metrics unchanged on its own"
" port and adds engine-neutral ``aibrix:`` copies, which the metric "
"mapping below does not read. The engine label works without it."
msgstr ""
"可选的 :doc:`runtime` sidecar 是另一套机制，目前仅适用于 "
"vLLM。它在自己的端口上原样提供引擎指标，并额外提供与引擎无关的 ``aibrix:`` "
"副本，下方的指标映射不会读取这些副本。引擎标签不依赖它也能工作。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:70
msgid "Configuration reference"
msgstr "配置参考"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:72
msgid ""
"Everything is configured with pod labels. Set them on the pod template of"
" the ``Deployment`` (or of the ``StormService`` role) rather than on the "
"workload object itself."
msgstr ""
"全部通过 Pod 标签配置。请把它们设在 ``Deployment`` （或 ``StormService`` 角色）的 Pod "
"模板上，而不是工作负载对象本身。"

