#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:98
msgid "Supported Metrics"
msgstr "支持的指标"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:100
msgid ""
"Only a limited set of metrics is mapped for each engine, and more will be"
" added over time. For a routing policy implemented through the `routing "
"policy API <https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/aibrix/tree/main/pkg/plugins/gateway/algorithms>`_, use a metric "
"your target engine exports. Most policies fall back to random when they "
"cannot score a pod; see *How it works* above for the exceptions."
msgstr ""
"每种引擎目前只映射有限的一组指标，后续会继续增加。对于通过 `routing policy API <https://github.com"
"/vllm-project/aibrix/tree/main/pkg/plugins/gateway/algorithms>`_ "
"实现的路由策略，请使用目标引擎会导出的指标。多数策略在无法给 Pod 打分时退回到随机；例外见上文 *How it works*。"

