"`https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/5979 <https://github.com"
"/sgl-project/sglang/issues/5979>`_"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:351
msgid ""
"The table lists metrics read directly from each engine. AIBrix also "
"defines query-based metrics that Prometheus computes, such as "
"``avg_prompt_toks_per_req``, ``avg_generation_toks_per_req``, "
"``p95_ttft_5m`` and ``avg_e2e_latency_pod``. Their PromQL is written "
"against vLLM metric names, so they are available for vLLM only. "
"``drain_rate_1m`` is the exception: it is written against SGLang metric "
"names."
msgstr ""
"该表列出的是直接从各引擎读取的指标。AIBrix 还定义了由 Prometheus 计算的查询类指标，例如 "
"``avg_prompt_toks_per_req`` 、``avg_generation_toks_per_req`` "
"、``p95_ttft_5m`` 和 ``avg_e2e_latency_pod`` 。它们的 PromQL 基于 vLLM "
"指标名称编写，因此仅适用于 vLLM。 ``drain_rate_1m`` 是例外：它基于 SGLang 指标名称编写。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:354
msgid "TRT-LLM Quickstart"
msgstr "TRT-LLM 快速开始"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/multi-engine.rst:356
msgid ""
"To use TRT-LLM as the inference engine, set the ``model.aibrix.ai/engine:"
" trtllm`` label on your deployment. TRT-LLM must be configured to expose "
"performance metrics by enabling ``return_perf_metrics: true``, "
"``enable_iter_perf_stats: true``, and ``enable_iter_req_stats: true`` in "
"its server config."
msgstr ""
"要将 TRT-LLM 用作推理引擎，请在 deployment 上设置 ``model.aibrix.ai/engine: trtllm`` 标签"
"。TRT-LLM 必须在其 server config 中启用 ``return_perf_metrics: true`` "
"、``enable_iter_perf_stats: true`` 和 ``enable_iter_req_stats: true`` "
"，以暴露性能指标。"

